	<string>SORA Wallet uses the camera to scan QR codes.</string>
	<key>NSFaceIDUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SORA Wallet uses Face ID to unlock your wallet and confirm sensitive actions.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SORA Wallet saves a QR code image to your photos when you choose Save Image.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>SORA Wallet reads a QR code from a photo you choose.</string>
